    I2C11, I2C13, I2C14, I2CCornerCaseTest, I2CRandomizedTest) crash at about 200
    ns on a spurious ack_error mismatch against a reference model run with a fabricated
    all-zero stimulus (start=0, slave_addr=0x0000), while observed ack_error tracks
    the real transactions (e.g. 0 for supported 0x50); I2C10StartWhileBusyTest fails
